*> Shared helpers of the 44-3 tests (lane 002-lane-p49h): COPY after the test program. Q3-CHECK USING case (X(240)), expected, observed (BINARY-DOUBLE).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. Q3-CHECK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-CASE                  PIC X(240).
 01 L-EXPECTED              BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 L-OBSERVED              BINARY-DOUBLE.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-CASE L-EXPECTED L-OBSERVED.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE L-CASE TO TL-CASE
     MOVE L-EXPECTED TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE L-OBSERVED TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM Q3-CHECK.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. Q3-EQ.
*> Q3-EQ USING case (X(240)), expected, observed (BINARY-LONG): a numeric case of the 44-3 tests.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-CASE                  PIC X(240).
 01 L-EXPECTED              BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-OBSERVED              BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-CASE L-EXPECTED L-OBSERVED.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE L-CASE TO TL-CASE
     MOVE L-EXPECTED TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE L-OBSERVED TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM Q3-EQ.
